    "forecastPreviousActualNote": "forecast/previous/actual are intentionally null — there is no live data feed behind this page yet. The UI renders null as — rather than inventing plausible-looking numbers.",
    "scheduleStatusNote": "scheduleStatus is one of confirmed/tentative/unpublished/cancelled, carried per row since 2026-11-09. lastCheckedAt is the date each row's date/time was last read directly off its own sourceUrl, not today's date for every row."
